<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Kwamashi 2022</book>
  <para style="h">EFESE</para>
  <para style="toc1">Diñoro dya Paulu kwa AkwaEfese</para>
  <para style="toc2">AkwaEfese</para>
  <para style="toc3">Efe</para>
  <para style="mt2">Diñoro dya Paulu kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">AkwaEfese</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="rem">AM, TC, TA, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvumenena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Yame no Paulu kanganda ka Krisitu Yesu keshima ya Nyambi. Naa ñorera anua Nyambi awa a di mu Efese awa a na rurama kwa Krisitu Yesu.<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Nyambi Tata wetu na Fumu Yesu Krisitu a mi pe thsihemo no thsiyaro.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thsiyauthzi mwa Krisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Ku shangariwe Nyambi, Tata wa Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu, oyu na a tu fiyawera mwa Krisitu ko thsiyauthzi thsothsihe thso mupepo mu mandau o mu wiru. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Inene Nyambi wa tu shimine no ku tu hangura mwa Krisitu kaye o ku ka shime no kumbiwa, ci twikare owakenu, karo o kupira kapongonyi pa meho enthzi. <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Nyambi wa cihangwerire cimo ku twañura kwikara anenthzi mwa Yesu Krisitu. Wa tendire kengeyo komu ya mu nyanyukithserire nomu a i shimenine. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Tu shangare Nyambi mukaci ko thsihemo thsenthzi thso kutethzima ethsi a tu pire ka Mwanenthzi oyu a shima. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Inene konyinga wa Krisitu, na tu paturiwa no ku teteriwa evi yetu kokuru o thsihemo thsa Nyambi, <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />ethsi a tu rundumwethzire, konyanyami no kuyuvithsithsa.<verse eid="EPH 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Nyambi na a tu hokwera diano dyeshima yenthzi kokuthza komu ya mu roerithserire nawa, edi a anekerire ku manenena mwa Krisitu. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Eanekera yenthzi eyi a ku manenena thsikati ethsi thsi na roera ou thsa ku kuma po ku waneka pofoci enu yo mu wiru no mu kaye no ku i paka mukoro wa Krisitu.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Twa hanguriwire mwa Krisitu ku tunda ku matatekero ci twikare ana Nyambi keanekera yenthzi aye oyu o ku twethsa ku tenda enu yoihe omu a na shimena kokuthza kesheteka yenthzi neshima yenthzi,<verse eid="EPH 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />ci atwe twa tangire ku kurupera mwa Krisitu ci nga tu rete kushangara ku kutethzima kwenthzi. <verse eid="EPH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Namwe kengeyo, ou mwa yuvire muthzimbu o shemwa, ao Muthzimbu Ouwa wa Nyambi o kuyoyithsiwa kwenu, mwa tawire kwa Yesu Krisitu, karo Nyambi wa mi pakire thsitamba thso Mupepo Oukenu oyu a kumbwethzire. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Mupepo Oukenu po thsitanarithso thso kuninga ci kenge twa ku tambura eyi a tu kumbwethzire Nyambi, karo ci Nyambi na a tu patura kwikara anuenthzi. Tu shangare kutethzima kwenthzi.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa romberera akwakutawa o mu Efese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Mweyo, ku tunda apa na ni yuvera yo thsitawo thsenu kwa Fumu Yesu no thsishimo thsenu kwanua Nyambi wahe, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />ka na ni thsii ku kanderera kwa Nyambi mukaci kenu no ku mi vurukanga mwirombero yange. <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />Naa romba Nyambi wa Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu, aye Tata o kutethzima, ci a mi pe Mupepo ou nga u mi nyanyamithsa no ku mi nehethza Nyambi ci mu mu dimuke shemwa. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Naa rombera ci Mupepo Oukenu a muneke mu micima thzenu, ci mu dimuke okurupero ou na a mithsera, nokuru o thsiyauthzi thso kutethzima ethsi a na turekera anuenthzi.<verse eid="EPH 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />Karo naa rombera ci mu yuvithsithse okoro wa Nyambi ou u kwama mu mwetu atwe tu na tawa. Oo okoro odiyo okoro oshokuru, <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />ou a cikwathsithsire Nyambi ou a pindurire Krisitu kwafu no ku mwikarithsa ku dyoko dyenthzi dyo rudyo mu mandau o ku wiru. <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Oko Krisitu a di peuru thzakwakutumina wahe, kutumina, okoro nji mafumu no mathzina oahe aa a nethsiwa, kadi mo kano kaye pohuma unone no kaye aka ka keya. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Nyambi na a paka enu yoihe kushi thzedyato ya Krisitu, karo naa mu pa ci peuru thzenu yoihe yodiyo mutwi o kereke. <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Kereke po erama ya Krisitu, ethzi thzi na yara no ku kwanenena mwa Krisitu, aye oyu na yara mwinu yoihe kokuhe kokuhe.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="rem">AM, TC, TA, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Munu aa yoyithsiwa ko thsihemo thsa Nyambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Shime mwaa fa mukaci ko mirandu nevi yenu. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Kethsiya thsikati mwa shupwerire etenda yoimango yo kaye no ku shupwera Satana muendithsi o mipepo thzoshokoro thzo mu wiruwiru, ao mupepo u endithsa thsino thsikati anu awa na kana ku remeka Nyambi. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Twahe dyo twekarire eci awo, shime twaa tendanga eshima yerama neanekera yetu. Eci munu yomuhe, natwe wa tu roerire oanthzi wa Nyambi.<verse eid="EPH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Unone pakuninga ci Nyambi wa ñeke nene, wa tu shimine nene, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />shaanga ci shime twaa fa mukaci kevi yetu, wa tu pindurire kwafu pofoci na Krisitu. Mukaci ko thsihemo thsenthzi, na mu yoyithsiwa. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Nyambi wa tu pindurire pofoci na Krisitu no ku twikarithsa nenthzi mu mandau o mu wiru mwa Krisitu Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Nyambi wa tendire kengeyo ci mwikati eyi i keya nga a ku monithse okuru o thsihemo thsenthzi ethsi a tu shimine mwa Krisitu Yesu.<verse eid="EPH 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Inene na mu yoyithsiwa ko thsihemo thsa Nyambi ko thsitawo. Oko kuyoyithsiwa kadi cingwa kwaa tunda ku kwenu, unone thsipa thsa Nyambi. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Kuyoyithsiwa po kadi cingwa kwaa tunda pekwama, mweyo, kwithsa oyu nga ku cishangarera. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Inene atwe po twekwama yo moko enthzi. Wa tumbire mwa Krisitu Yesu ci tu tende ekwama yoiwa eyi a tu roithserire cimo Nyambi ci tu i tende.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kwikara thsofoci mwa Krisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Mweyo, amwe mwerekiwire Anukenge, mu vuruke ci shime na mwithsiwanga ku Majuda ci “akwakukana ku thza ku mukanda,” ao ou u na tendiwanga perama ko moko anu. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Mu vuruke ci kethsiya thsikati shime mwa tepiwire kwa Krisitu. Mwekarire enda mu ditunga dya Isiraele, karo ka mwa vandire kwiyuvano yo thsikumbwethzo thsa Nyambi kwanuenthzi. Mwa yoyire muno mu kaye ko kupira okurupero no kupira Nyambi. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Uno honi mwa Krisitu Yesu, amwe mwekarire kokure na Nyambi na mu retiwa po pepi nenthzi konyinga wa Krisitu.<verse eid="EPH 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Inene aye Krisitu shemwa yodiyo thsiyaro thsetu, oyu naa waneka Majuda nAnukenge kwikara mbunga thzofoci. Ko ku pa erama yenthzi pa mbinda, naa umburura mufuo o thsithzimbo ethsi thsa tu tepire. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Wa pwithsire murao netumina neraerera yao ci nga a cikwamene mu mwenthzi aye thsinda mbunga thzofoci thzothzipe pethzo mishovo thzidi ci a rete thsiyaro. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Ko kufa kwenthzi pa mbinda, Yesu na a waneka mishovo thzidi kwikara erama yofoci no ku thzi huthsera kwa Nyambi. Mweyo, na a mana thsithzimbo thso.<verse eid="EPH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Krisitu wa keyire ku na honga Muthzimbu Ouwa o thsiyaro ku kwenu amwe mwAnukenge amwe mwekarire kokure na Nyambi, no ku Majuda awa ekarire po pepi nenthzi. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Inene kenthzi aye Krisitu twahe twaa twethsa ku kuma kwa Nyambi Tata ko Mupepo ofoci.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Apo honi amwe mwAnukenge ka mu di karo mwenda nji matundakure, unone mwakwa ditunga dyofoci nanua Nyambi, mwakwa mwanda ofoci wa Nyambi. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Namwe kengeyo na mu umbiwa pa mushisho o tunganda nakwakukethza, Krisitu Yesu yodiyo diunthzi dyo nthzio. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Pa penthzi podiyo thsi na umbiwa thsiumba no ku kura kwikara Tembere thzothzikenu thza Fumu. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Mu mwenthzi, namwe mwaa umbiwera pofoci namweya ku tenda nthzio omu a yoya Nyambi ko Mupepo wenthzi.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="rem">AM, TC, TA, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Ekwama ya Paulu yo ku kwathsa Anukenge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Mukaci keyi, ame no Paulu, ame no thsinthzinda thsa Krisitu Yesu ku kwathsa amwe mwAnukenge.<verse eid="EPH 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Yoshemwa na mu yuvu yekwama yo thsihemo thsa Nyambi eyi na piwire mukaci kenu. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Eci diya na ni ñoro kare ko wipi, Nyambi aye thsinda wa hokorire ku kwange diano dyeanekera yenthzi. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Yoihe mu tara eyi ni na ñoro, mwaa twethsa ku yuvithsithsa odimukero wange o diano dya Krisitu. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Edi diano ka dya hokoriwire kwanu o mwikati imweya, pano honi Nyambi na a di hokora ko Mupepo wenthzi ku tunganda nakwakukethza owakenu. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Edi diano dya Nyambi po ci ko Muthzimbu Ouwa, Anukenge aa ciwana no Majuda mu kushwana, wahe epo yerama yofoci, karo wahe aa ciera eyi a kumbwethzire Nyambi mwa Krisitu Yesu.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Nyambi ko thsipa thso thsihemo thsenthzi wa ni hangurire kwikara ngamba ou Muthzimbu Ouwa. Wa tendire eyi kokoro wenthzi.<verse eid="EPH 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Shaanga ci no muonye kwanua Nyambi wahe, Nyambi ko thsihemo thsenthzi naa ni pa ku honga Muthzimbu Ouwa wa Krisitu kwAnukenge, rufumo ro kukana ku twethsa ku fotithsithsiwa. <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />Karo naa ni pa ku tongonwena anu wahe yodi diano edi a horekire Nyambi mwikati yo ku manyima, aye oyu wombire enu yoihe.<verse eid="EPH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />Nyambi wa tendire kengeyo ci ko kereke a monithse onyanyami wenthzi oungi kwaendithsi noku kweyi yoikoro yo mu mandau o mu wiru. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Wa tendire kengeyo mukaci keanekera yenthzi yo diyere eyi naa manenena mwa Krisitu Yesu Fumu wetu.<verse eid="EPH 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Mwa Yesu Krisitu no thsitawo thsetu ku kwenthzi twaa twethsa honi ku keya pa meho a Nyambi kondume no ku tawa shemwa. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Mweyo, naa mi romba ci mwa huka munyima mukaci ko makando ange aa ni mi nyandera, inene kenge a ku mi retera kutethzima.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulu aa romberera AkwaEfese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Mukaci keyi, naa tongama pa meho a Nyambi Tata, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />oku u tundithsa mukuta no mukuta o mu wiru no pa kaye dithzina. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Naa rombera ci ku rufumo rwenthzi ro kutethzima nga a mi tanarithse micima thzenu kokoro, ko Mupepo wenthzi, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />ci Krisitu nga ekare mu micima thzenu ko thsitawo thsenu, ci nga mu kure no ku tanara mu thsishimo. <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />Naa rombera ci amwe nakwakutawa wahe nga mu yuvithsithse wipi no mwando, ore nothzungi o thsishimo thsa Krisitu, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />no ku dimuka thsishimo thsa Krisitu ethsi thsi piterera odimukero, ci nga mu twethse ku yara ko kukwanenena kwa Nyambi kokuhe.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Uno honi ku kwenthzi aye oyu di nokoro o ku tenda yoshokuru ku piterera eyi tu na rombanga nji ku anekera, kokuthza kokoro wenthzi ou u kwama mu mwetu, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />ku kwenthzi kwikare kutethzima mu kereke nomu mwa Krisitu Yesu mwikati yoihe, diyere na diyere! Ameni.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TA, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Kwikara thsofoci mwirama ya Krisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Mweyo, naa adikana ku mi romba ame no thsinthzinda mukaci ko ku kwamena Fumu, ci mu yoye mwoyo ou u na roera kwithsiwa oku na mwithsiwera. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Thsikati thsothsihe mu cihuthse kushi no kuwamucima, mu kwate micima, mu cikunde namweya mu thsishimo. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Mu kwame momuhe omu mu na twethsera ci mu twarerere ku cikwata mu Mupepo ko thsiyaro ethsi thsi na mi waneka. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Ko i di erama yofoci no Mupepo ofoci, eci edi mwethsiwerire kukurupero ofoci. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Ku di Fumu yofoci, thsitawo thsofoci, korovethzo thzofoci, <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Nyambi yofoci aye Tata wanu wahe, oyu na endithsa wahe, karo oyu kwama mu mwo wahe, karo oyu di mu mwo wahe.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Uno honi munu no munu ku kwetu naa piwa thsipa komu naa tu pera Krisitu. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Eyo ngeyi a na ambera Mañoro ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">“Ou a thzinine po kuthzinama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">wa shimbire dikanga dyakwakupukuriwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">no ku pa epa kwanuenthzi.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />(Pa ku amba ci: “Wa thzinine mu wiru” yaa monithsa ci shime a tangire tango ku shurumukera mu kaye. <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Oyu wa shurumukire yodiyo karo wa thzinine ku piterera mawiru oahe ci nga a yare mwinu yoyihe). <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Krisitu yodiyo wa pire tunganda, akwakukethza, angambi, adithsani narongithsi, <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />ku pa okoro anuenthzi ku kwama ekwama yenthzi no ku umba kereke, ayo erama ya Krisitu. <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />Eyi kenge ya ku twarerera shime ku ka kuma apa twa kwikarera no kucikwata mu thsitawo no mudimukero o ku yara wa Mwana Nyambi no ku kura mu thsitawo mane shime ku cishoka na Krisitu ko kuyara.<verse eid="EPH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Apo honi ka twa kwikara karo anuke, ku cimbathzokithsiwa ku mañithsingi no ku pungithsiwa ku mupepo ou u furafura werongithsa yo mbango, yo dinyanyamena yo kwangera yanu eyi a peremeka. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Uno honi, kenge twa ku amba oshemwa mu thsishimo, no ku kura momuhe eci Krisitu, aye mutwi werama athzo kereke. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Ku kwenthzi erama yoihe kodiyo i na cinunganungera no ku kwatiwa pofoci ko ku tanarithsiwa ku mithsipa thzothzihe. Yaa kura no ku ciumba yothsinda mu thsishimo, thsipo no thsipo o ku thsi kwama ekwama yathso.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwoyo oupe mwa Krisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Pano honi naa mi tongwera eyi, karo naa i tanarithsa mu dithzina dya Fumu. Mwa yoya karo eci mahedeni edi a na kwamanga, keanekera yo yo mbango. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Eanekera yo mu mirema i di, karo a na tepiwa ku mwoyo wa Nyambi mukaci ko kukana kwo ku dimukera enu, mukaci kokaru o micima thzo. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Ka di no honyi. Nengena mu ungurunde, karo a na yara rununa ro ku tenda enu yoihe yo dithziro.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Unone eyo kadi yodiyo mwa cirongithsire keyi ya Krisitu. <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Pakuninga ci na mu yuvu ya Yesu no ku yuva oshemwa ou u tunda ku kwenthzi, <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />mu konthze onu wenu o kare no muyoyero wenu o kare ou u di necikumbwethza yoimango yerama no kwangera. <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />Mupepo wa Nyambi u tende ope maano no mianekerero thzenu. <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />Mu vate onu oupe, ou umbiwa kwikara eci Nyambi, owawa o shemwa nokenu.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Mweyo, munu no munu ku kwenu a thsie kwangera, a ambe yoshemwa kwa muenthzenthzi, inene twaheno twepo yerama yofoci. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />“O ku mu na anthzipa mwa tenda thsivi” Dya ka toka diyuwa shimbi mwa anthzipera. <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />Mwa pa shamaonga dipenga. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Mwithzi a thsie withzi honi, a kwame ko moko enthzi ekwama yoiwa, ci nga ekare nethsi thsimweya ethsi nga a citapera nowa a na piri.<verse eid="EPH 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Mwa tunda maywi ohungu mu tunwa twenu, unone ku tunde maywi oawa o ku twethsa ku umba amweya keyi i na fotahara kukwo, ci nga a kwathse awa a teerera. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Mwa tendithsa Mupepo Oukenu wa Nyambi thsorokoto, inene yodiyo mwa pakiwire thsitamba kenthzi ko diyuwa dyo ku paturiwa. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Mu thsie ndurungera thzothzihe, noanthzi, no kuanthzipa, maywi oamango, kwipithsa amweya mathzina, mofoci kengeyo no mishovo thzothzihe thzo mikarero thzothzimango. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Mwikare no thsihemo kwamweya, mu ciyuvere ñeke oandu, no ku tetera amweya, eci Nyambi edi a mi teterire mwa Krisitu.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TA, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Kuyoya mu mwethzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Mweyo, ko kwikara ana Nyambi awa a shima, mu mu temunune. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Mu yoye o ku mu endithsiwa mu thsishimo, eci Krisitu oyu wa tu shimine mane no ku pa mwoyo wenthzi mukaci ketu kwikara thsiyambero, munuko o ku roerithsa Nyambi.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Uno honi ruthziho neyi yo dithziro yoihe no rununa ka i roerire ku ambiwa mu kaci kenu, inene eyo ka i roerire mu kaci kanua Nyambi. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Karo kwa ambiwa yo dithziro nji eambaura yotomba nji dipome dyo ku piterera, unone kwikare okanderero. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Mu dimuke shemwa ci kwithsa munu o ruthziho nji o dithziro nji o rununa aye o ku rombera ekupuro, oyu wa ku tambura Kutumina kwa Krisitu na Nyambi. <verse eid="EPH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Mwa tawethza munu ku miangera ko maywi o mbango, inene mukaci keyo oanthzi wa Nyambi waa keya kowa a na kana ku mu yuvera. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Mweyo, mwa vanda kwinu eyi a kwama.<verse eid="EPH 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Pa kutanga mwekarire mirema, pano honi mwa mwethzi mwa Fumu. Mu yoye eci anu o mwethzi. <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />Inene mwethzi ou u di mu mwenu waa reta pohuma yoiwa nowawa noshemwa. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Mu fotithsithse nawa yo ku roerithsa Fumu. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Mwa vanda kwinu yo mirema i shikwathsa thsimweya, unone mu i rete mu mwethzi. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Inene yaa fithsa honyi shaanga ku ambaura enu eyi a na kwamanga kokumengi awa a na kana ku yuvera Nyambi. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Uno honi thsinu thsothsihe yoihe thsi retiwa mu mwethzi, thsaa monahara. <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />Inene thsinu thsothsihe ethsi thsi na monaharithsiwa po mwethzi. Eyi ngeyi ku na ambiwera ci,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">“O pinduke, owe o na rara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">o pinduke kwafu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">no Krisitu kenge a ku munekera.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Mweyo, mu mamere omu mu yoyera. Mwa yoya eci etomba, unone mu yoye eci owanyanyami. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Mu cikwathsithse nawa thsikati thsothsihe, inene ano mayuwa amango. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Mweyo, mwa tenda eci etomba, unone mu ereke ku fotithsithsa eshima ya Fumu. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Mwa penda waine, inene eyo kenge ya ku mipithsa. Unone mu yare Mupepo. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Mu ambaure namweya ko membo o kwimbera Nyambi, membo o ku shangara Nyambi no membo o ku mupepo, mwimbere Fumu no ku mu shangara mu micima thzenu. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Thsikati thsothsihe no mwinu yoihe mu kanderere kwa Nyambi Tata mu dithzina dya Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anu nanuwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Mu cihuthse kushi oandu ku tunderera mu ku remeka Krisitu.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Ambuyama, mu cihuthse kushi thzanuwenu, eci edi mu na kwamanga kwa Fumu. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Inene mukwerume yodiyo mutwi wa munuwenthzi eci edi a di Krisitu mutwi o kereke, ayo erama yenthzi, karo aye mwene yodiyo Muyoyithsi wathzo. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Eci edi thzi cihuthsa kushi thza Krisitu kereke, nambuyama nawo a cihuthse kushi mwinu yoihe kwanuwo.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Akwerume, mu shime anuwenu, eci edi a shimine Krisitu kereke no ku cipa yothsinda mukaci kathzo. <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />Wa kwamine kengeyo ku thzi kwama thzothzikenu, ku thzi kenithsa ko ku thzi yoa ko meyu ko diywi dyenthzi, <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />ci nga a yareke kereke pa meho enthzi mu kutethzima kwathzo, thzo kupira dithziro nji tukonde nji ngara katamwethzi, unone thzothzikenu no kupira kapongonyi. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Mofoci, akwerume aa roera ku shima anuwo eci edi a na shimanga erama yo athsinda. Mukwerume o ku shima munuwenthzi aa cishima yothsinda. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Kwithsa o ku thzimba erama yenthzi, unone aa i korera no ku i vavarera, eci Krisitu edi a vavarera kereke, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />inene atwe po yerama yenthzi.<verse eid="EPH 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />Eci edi ku na ñoriwa ci: “Mweyo, mukwerume kenge a ku thsia tata wenthzi no mama wenthzi no ku cikwata na munuwenthzi, karo awo aidi kenge mba piruka thsirama thsofoci.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Edi po diano dyodikuru, unone naa monithsa edi a di Krisitu no kereke. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Uno honi, mukwerume yomuhe a shime munuwenthzi eci edi a cishima thsinda, karo mbuyama a remeke munuwenthzi.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="rem">TA, TA, CC</para>
  <para style="s1">Ana nashemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Ana, mu yuvere ashemienu pa meho a Fumu, inene eyi po yo i na roera. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />“O remeke tata woe na mama woe,” athso thsiraerera thso kutanga ethsi thsi di no thsikumbwethzo ci, <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />“ci nga enu i ku endere nawa no ku yoya thsikati thsothsire pa kaye.”<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Namwe mwashemi wakwerume, mwa anthzipithsa anenu komu mu wa kwamena. Unone mu wa rere ko ku wa kuturura neraerera eyi i tunda kwa Fumu.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Apika nañathsire</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Apika, mu yuvere añathsire wenu o pano pa kaye ko ku wa yapa no ku tutuma, mu wa kwamene ko mucima ofoci, eci dyodi nga mu kwamena Krisitu. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Mwa kwama kengeyo pohuma ku wa roerithsa o kwa na mi tanekera, unone mu kwame kengeyo eci apika Krisitu, mu kwame eshima ya Nyambi ko micima thzenu thzothzihe. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Mu kwame ko micima thzenu thzothzihe eci mwaa kwamena Fumu, kadi anu. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Mu dimuke ci Fumu kenge a ku na pa muyambo munu no munu ku kwetu keyi yoiwa tu kwama, ikare mupika nji o kurukuruka.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Añathsire, namwe mu tende kengeyo apikenu. Mwa wa kanya, mu dimuke ci momu widi wenu mu di no ñathsire wenu yofoci mu wiru, karo ka a wana mavwevwe.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Erwithsa ya Mukrisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Ko ku manenena, mu tanare mwa Fumu no mukoro wenthzi oukuru. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Mu cishupeke erwithsa yoihe ya Nyambi ci nga mu korope no ku tanara ku kandeka maperemeka oahe a shamaonga. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Inene mvo ethzi tu rwa po kadi cingwa twaa thzi rwa nanu, unone twaa rwa nakwakutumina, yoikoro, okoro o kano kaye ko mirema, no mipepo thzothzikoro ethzi thzi di mu mandau o mu wiru.<figure style="fig" alt="Armour of God" file="gt00122.jpg" size="col" loc="Eph 6:10-17" copy="Gordon" ref="6.10-17">Erwithsa ya Mukrisitu.</figure><verse eid="EPH 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Mweyo, mu shimbe yoihe erwithsa ya Nyambi ci mwa ku twethse ku ciamwena thsikati ou thsa ku keya. Karo munyima thzo mvo kenge mwa ku thsiara shimbi mwa tanarera. <verse eid="EPH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Mweyo, mwimane no ku tanara. Oshemwa wikare mwiya wenu ou mu cianga mu mbunda, owawa wikare thsicandekithso thsenu thso pa miidi. <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />Kwidyato mu vate ociroithsero ou u tunda ku Muthzimbu Ouwa o thsiyaro. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Mwikati yoihe mu shimbe thsikandekithso thso thsitawo ethsi mu twethsa ku thzimithsa masho o ku yuuma oyu o Mumango. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Kuyoyithsiwa kwikare thsikoko thsenu, karo mu shimbe mwere o Mupepo, adyo diywi dya Nyambi.<verse eid="EPH 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Mu rombere mu Mupepo thsikati thsothsihe no mwitendahara yoihe. Mweyo mu mamere, karo mwikare no muooto oukuru no ku romberera akwakutawa wahe.<verse eid="EPH 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Name mu ni romberere. Mu rombe Nyambi ci a ni pe maywi aa a na roera ci nga ni twethse ku tongonona nawa kondume diano dyeanekera ya Nyambi ci Muthzimbu Ouwa po wa Majuda nAnukenge. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Mu madyenge ni di mukaci ko Muthzimbu Ouwa ko kwikara mwimaneni wa Nyambi. Mweyo, mu rombere ci ni tware ku rupara ku amba kondume, omu ni na roera ku ambera.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuvumenena ko mahurerero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Tikike, muenthzetu oyu na shimiwa, karo aye ngamba wa Fumu o ku rurama kenge a ku na mi tongwera enu yoihe, ci mu dimuke edi ni na pinduka. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Eyi ngeyi ni na mu tumena oko, ci nga mu dimuke edi tu di, karo ci nga naa mi tanarithse micima.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Andengenu, thsiyaro thsikare nenu, karo Nyambi Tata no Fumu Yesu Krisitu a mi pe thsishimo no thsitawo. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Thsihemo thsa Nyambi thsikare kwanu wahe awa na shimi Fumu wetu Yesu Krisitu ko thsishimo thso kukana ku pwa.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>